    <briefdescription>
<para>Named continuous aggregate definition. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Analogous to TimescaleDB&apos;s: CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW &lt;name&gt; WITH (timescaledb.continuous) AS SELECT time_bucket(&lt;window&gt;, time_col) bucket, min(val) AS min, max(val) AS max, avg(val) AS avg, sum(val) AS sum, count(*) AS count FROM &lt;source_metric&gt; GROUP BY bucket;</para>
<para>The derived metric is stored in <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_store" kindref="compound">TSStore</ref> under the name produced by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_continuous_aggregate_manager_1a5c08da389c51794339466931f880ba82" kindref="member">ContinuousAggregateManager::derivedMetricName</ref>(config.metric, config.window.size). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
